# Runtime binaries and authoring sources stay local; only the versioned campaign contracts are
# tracked so code cannot point at manifests that exist solely in one ignored checkout.
/assets/*
# This single CC0 character is intentionally source-controlled so a fresh checkout can reproduce
# the crew bake. Keep every sibling asset warehouse path ignored.
!/assets/flavor/
/assets/flavor/*
!/assets/flavor/Characters/
/assets/flavor/Characters/*
!/assets/flavor/Characters/german-ww2-soldier-cc0/
!/assets/flavor/Characters/german-ww2-soldier-cc0/**
